  "summary": "GREENWICH, Conn., July 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- XPO (NYSE: XPO) today announced its financial results for the second quarter 2026. The company reported diluted earnings per share of $1.36, compared with $0.89 for the same period in 2025, and adjusted diluted earnings per share of $1.70,",
